DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aannddll driver provides support for the Andigilog aSC7611 hardware moni‐
     tor.  The device provides 3 temperature sensors, 5 voltage sensors and 4
     fan sensors.  Sensor values are made available through the sysctl(8) in‐
     terface.

